                </p>

                <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4">

                    <a href="#order" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-matcha-600 text-white font-semibold text-base hover:bg-matcha-700 transition shadow-lg shadow-matcha-600/20 text-center">
